        "stage": 74,
        "statement": "Flooding on Main Street in Bonners Ferry and into the buildings. Seepage through levees increases. "
      },
      {
        "stage": 66,
        "statement": "Water will begin to encroach upon the lawn of the Kootenai River Inn. Some homes downstream of Bonners Ferry will be cut off from accesss roads. "
      },
      {
        "stage": 64,
        "statement": "There will be minor flooding along the agricultural lands of the Kootenai Valley due to seepage and high water tables. Some private roads near the levees may also experience minor flooding from seepage. "
      }
    ]
